{"seq":4,"slug":"linguistics","title":"语言学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics","introMarkdown":"# 语言学 简介\n\n语言学是对人类语言进行科学研究的学科，它关注语言的结构规律、使用方式、习得过程和社会功能。与学习某一种具体语言不同，语言学追问的是更根本的问题：语言为什么具有这样的结构？儿童如何在短短几年内掌握如此复杂的系统？语言如何反映和塑造我们的思维方式？为什么世界上存在数千种语言，它们之间又有哪些共通的深层规律？\n\n自学者进入语言学领域时，最大的思维转变是学会把语言当作一个客观对象来观察和分析，而不仅仅是一个交流工具。你每天使用的母语中蕴含着精密的语音系统、复杂的句法规则和微妙的语用策略，只是这些知识通常以无意识的形式运作。语言学正是将这种隐性知识显性化的学科。\n\n第一章**理论语言学**从语音学、句法学和语义学三个核心分支出发，建立对语言结构分析的基本功。第二章**应用语言学**探讨语言学理论如何服务于第二语言教学、语料库建设和语言规划等实际需求。第三章**社会语言学**关注语言与社会的互动关系，分析语言变异、语言政策和双语现象背后的社会动因。第四章**计算语言学**是语言学与计算机科学的交叉领域，涵盖自然语言处理、语音识别和机器翻译等前沿方向。\n\n建议以理论语言学为起点打好分析基础，然后根据个人兴趣向应用方向延伸。学习过程中保持对周围语言现象的好奇心——方言差异、网络用语的演变、儿童的语言错误——这些都是绝佳的语言学观察素材。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-linguistics","title":"理论语言学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/theoretical-linguistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"phonetics-phonology","title":"语音学与音系学","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/theoretical-linguistics/phonetics-phonology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"syntax-morphology","title":"句法与形态学","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/theoretical-linguistics/syntax-morphology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"semantics-pragmatics","title":"语义与语用学","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/theoretical-linguistics/semantics-pragmatics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"applied-linguistics","title":"应用语言学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/applied-linguistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"second-language-acquisition","title":"第二语言习得","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/applied-linguistics/second-language-acquisition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-teaching-methods","title":"语言教学方法","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/applied-linguistics/language-teaching-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"corpus-linguistics","title":"语料库语言学","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/applied-linguistics/corpus-linguistics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"sociolinguistics","title":"社会语言学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/sociolinguistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-variation","title":"语言变异","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-variation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-policy","title":"语言政策","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bilingualism","title":"双语现象","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/sociolinguistics/bilingualism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"computational-linguistics","title":"计算语言学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"natural-language-processing","title":"自然语言处理","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/natural-language-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"speech-recognition","title":"语音识别","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/speech-recognition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"machine-translation","title":"机器翻译","url":"/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/machine-translation"}]}]}